  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperative Development Program (CDP) - Frontier</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the CDP APS mechanism and in support of locally-led development, E3/LS will provide funding to Frontier to implement cooperative development activities in Sri Lanka. Specifically, Frontier will work with local spice cooperatives to improve agricultural and processing practices which aim to increase exports and increase smallholder farmer incomes. Additionally, Frontier will promote the inclusion of a marginalized workforce by training youth, women and disabled persons on safe food safety and handling. These field-based activities build the capacity of local, democratic institutions and advance the Agency&apos;s objectives of local resource mobilization and self-reliance.</narrative>
  </description>
